@base = http://localhost:5093/api

### List every container known to the local Docker daemon
GET {{base}}/logs/containers

### Follow one container's logs (WebSocket upgrade; a plain GET returns 400)
GET {{base}}/logs/stream/secrets-mcp
Connection: Upgrade
Upgrade: websocket
Sec-WebSocket-Version: 13
Sec-WebSocket-Key: dGhlIHNhbXBsZSBub25jZQ==
